INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1,1,'2021-03-24 12:46:27','2021-03-24 12:46:27','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to WordPress. This is your first post. Edit or delete it, then start writing!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Hello world!','','publish','open','open','','hello-world','','','2021-03-24 12:46:27','2021-03-24 12:46:27','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?p=1',0,'post','',1),(6,1,'2021-03-24 12:54:17','2021-03-24 12:54:17','<label> Your name\n    [text* your-name] </label>\n\n<label> Your email\n    [email* your-email] </label>\n\n<label> Subject\n    [text* your-subject] </label>\n\n<label> Your message (optional)\n    [textarea your-message] </label>\n\n[submit \"Submit\"]\n[_site_title] \"[your-subject]\"\n[_site_title] <wordpress@staging.novajii.com>\nFrom: [your-name] <[your-email]>\nSubject: [your-subject]\n\nMessage Body:\n[your-message]\n\n-- \nThis e-mail was sent from a contact form on [_site_title] ([_site_url])\n[_site_admin_email]\nReply-To: [your-email]\n\n0\n0\n\n[_site_title] \"[your-subject]\"\n[_site_title] <wordpress@staging.novajii.com>\nMessage Body:\n[your-message]\n\n-- \nThis e-mail was sent from a contact form on [_site_title] ([_site_url])\n[your-email]\nReply-To: [_site_admin_email]\n\n0\n0\nThank you for your message. It has been sent.\nThere was an error trying to send your message. Please try again later.\nOne or more fields have an error. Please check and try again.\nThere was an error trying to send your message. Please try again later.\nYou must accept the terms and conditions before sending your message.\nThe field is required.\nThe field is too long.\nThe field is too short.\nThere was an unknown error uploading the file.\nYou are not allowed to upload files of this type.\nThe file is too big.\nThere was an error uploading the file.','Contact form 1','','publish','closed','closed','','contact-form-1','','','2021-03-24 12:54:17','2021-03-24 12:54:17','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?post_type=wpcf7_contact_form&p=6',0,'wpcf7_contact_form','',0),(7,1,'2021-03-24 12:56:25','2021-03-24 12:56:25','','woocommerce-placeholder','','inherit','open','closed','','woocommerce-placeholder','','','2021-03-24 12:56:25','2021-03-24 12:56:25','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/woocommerce-placeholder.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(24,1,'2019-02-20 10:37:39','2019-02-20 10:37:39','','aeroland-digital-store-hero-bg-reup','','inherit','open','closed','','aeroland-digital-store-hero-bg-reup','','','2019-02-20 10:37:39','2019-02-20 10:37:39','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/aeroland-digital-store-hero-bg-reup.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(32,1,'2019-02-21 07:02:47','2019-02-21 07:02:47','','blog-01','','inherit','open','closed','','blog-01','','','2021-03-24 13:01:05','2021-03-24 13:01:05','',2806,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/blog-01.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(40,1,'2019-02-22 02:26:11','2019-02-22 02:26:11','','blog-sidebar-ads','','inherit','open','closed','','blog-sidebar-ads','','','2019-02-22 02:26:11','2019-02-22 02:26:11','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/blog-sidebar-ads.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(42,1,'2019-02-22 02:36:20','2019-02-22 02:36:20','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s been said a million times before, if not more, but technology has revolutionised our lives in ways we never expected. From the home to the office, there’s no corner of our day-to-day lives that hasn’t been affected by the technological boom.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> Wireless technology changes every year too, and it’ll continue to change for as long as we can see. Below, we take a look at a few ways wireless tech has changed businesses so far. </p></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The office, in particular, has seen such dramatic changes <g class=\"gr_ gr_4 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar only-ins replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"4\" data-gr-id=\"4\">thanks</g> the improved LAN and WAN services over the last twenty years, allowing our offices to run smoothly, efficiently, and wirelessly. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> If there’s one way that wireless technology has changed the way we work, it’s that everyone is now connected, pretty much all the time. Previously, if someone called the office for you but you were out or on the way to a meeting, they’d have to wait to get hold of you.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\n\n (Source: blog.businesscasestudies.co.uk)\n\n</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','How Wireless Technology is Changing Business','If there’s one way that wireless technology has changed the way we work, it’s that everyone is now connected.','publish','open','open','','the-biggest-reset-looms-for-corporate-credit-market','','','2019-02-22 02:36:20','2019-02-22 02:36:20','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?p=42',0,'post','',3),(43,1,'2019-02-22 02:37:00','2019-02-22 02:37:00','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Blockchain technology is being hailed, by many, as a digital panacea that has already made a huge impact across sectors such as finance. The broad number of ways in which blockchain can be utilised.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> Changing or adding information to the “chain” requires the authentication of everyone who is in the network and this means that blockchain is extremely secure&nbsp; </p></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, is still being explored and the logistics sector is one area that is looking to exploit its power. Here we examine the fundamental principals behind blockchain and ask how is blockchain technology <g class=\"gr_ gr_5 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling multiReplace\" id=\"5\" data-gr-id=\"5\">revolutionising</g> the logistics sector?  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> <g class=\"gr_ gr_5 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar only-ins replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"5\" data-gr-id=\"5\">Blockchain</g> is basically a digital ledger that is shared by a network of individuals around the world and that came about from work carried out in mathematical discipline of cryptology. That is to say, the information stored in blockchain is encrypted. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\n\n (Source: blog.businesscasestudies.co.uk)\n\n</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Blockchain Technology Effects on Logistics Sector?','Changing or adding information to the “chain” requires the authentication of everyone who is in the network.','publish','open','open','','why-trump-is-so-clumsy-about-fighting-free-trade','','','2019-02-22 02:37:00','2019-02-22 02:37:00','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?p=43',0,'post','',3),(71,1,'2019-02-25 04:30:53','2019-02-25 04:30:53','','mitech-button-app-store-dark','','inherit','open','closed','','mitech-button-app-store-dark','','','2021-03-24 13:01:05','2021-03-24 13:01:05','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/mitech-button-app-store-dark.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(72,1,'2019-02-25 04:31:06','2019-02-25 04:31:06','','mitech-button-google-play-dark','','inherit','open','closed','','mitech-button-google-play-dark','','','2021-03-24 13:01:05','2021-03-24 13:01:05','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/mitech-button-google-play-dark.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(103,1,'2019-02-26 02:15:48','2019-02-26 02:15:48','<p>[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" content_placement=\"middle\" background_color=\"custom\" background_size=\"auto\" custom_background_color=\"#454545\" lg_spacing=\"padding_top:84;padding_bottom:84\" background_image=\"134\" background_position=\"top 35% right -68px\"][vc_column offset=\"vc_col-md-8\"][tm_heading style=\"highlight-01\" custom_google_font=\"\" sm_align=\"