jii.com/?testimonial=rex-watson',0,'testimonial','',0),(296,1,'2019-02-27 07:33:27','2019-02-27 07:33:27','','mitech-pricing-box-icon-01','','inherit','open','closed','','mitech-pricing-box-icon-01','','','2021-03-24 13:01:05','2021-03-24 13:01:05','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/mitech-pricing-box-icon-01.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(298,1,'2019-02-27 07:36:44','2019-02-27 07:36:44','','mitech-pricing-box-icon-02','','inherit','open','closed','','mitech-pricing-box-icon-02','','','2021-03-24 13:01:05','2021-03-24 13:01:05','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/mitech-pricing-box-icon-02.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(299,1,'2019-02-27 07:37:28','2019-02-27 07:37:28','','mitech-pricing-box-icon-03','','inherit','open','closed','','mitech-pricing-box-icon-03','','','2021-03-24 13:01:05','2021-03-24 13:01:05','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/mitech-pricing-box-icon-03.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(304,1,'2019-02-27 08:23:14','2019-02-27 08:23:14','','home-infotechno-contact-bg','','inherit','open','closed','','home-infotechno-contact-bg','','','2021-03-24 13:01:05','2021-03-24 13:01:05','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/home-infotechno-contact-bg.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(326,1,'2019-02-28 07:49:08','2019-02-28 07:49:08','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I base my professional and personal lives on the principles of neuroplasticity and believe it is imperative for CEOs and marketers to make a “brain connection” with their intended customers.&nbsp; The theories that I put forth in my book, NeuroPreneur, are vital to launching and operating a successful global business no matter the industry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> As a business person operating a global concern, I apply the principles I use in my personal life to make connections to succeed in the global marketplace. </p></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> To bring any business ideas to fruition, you must understand the <g class=\"gr_ gr_8 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"8\" data-gr-id=\"8\">NeuroPreneur</g> principles:&nbsp; especially how the three parts of the brain work. The brain is divided into the following parts:&nbsp; The inner part controls basic instinct. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> The middle part is called the emotional, brain-controlled feeling.&nbsp; The outer part controls logical reasoning. If you understand this basic brain scheme, you can design any approach to hook a customer’s inner brain as the first step toward reaching them.&nbsp;  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\n\n(Source: blog.businesscasestudies.co.uk)\n\n</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','The Keys to Persuading Customers Nowadays','The middle part is called the emotional, brain-controlled feeling.  The outer part controls logical reasoning. ','publish','open','open','','5-react-training-courses-for-beginners-2','','','2019-02-28 07:49:08','2019-02-28 07:49:08','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?p=326',0,'post','',3),(328,1,'2019-02-28 07:49:34','2019-02-28 07:49:34','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> It is very exciting moving into a new office because it often means that your business is expanding or moving up in class to attract <g class=\"gr_ gr_6 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling multiReplace\" id=\"6\" data-gr-id=\"6\">high end</g> clients. Whatever the reason it is absolutely critical to keep in mind the necessity of protecting your business data not just for your sake but also for the sake of your employees and clients who have placed their trust in you. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> It is far wiser to do your own installations and ensure that all data flowing through the organization has end-to-end encryption so that even if it is intercepted it cannot be used against you. </p></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Military forces rank and compartmentalize information in levels ranging from all personnel access to top secret clearance requirements. This strategy is easily applicable to businesses as an effective way to ensure that each employee only has access to information they require to perform their duties without giving them access to critical business secrets. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> This is especially critical for businesses in the technology sector where corporate espionage is rife and there have been several cases of rival companies sending spies to gather information on competitors. Company data can be <a href=\"https://digitalguardian.com/blog/what-data-classification-data-classification-definition\">classified into three categories</a>&nbsp;of public, private and sensitive with each category restricted to particular employees.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>(Source: blog.businesscasestudies.co.uk)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Data Secure on Transitioning to a New Office','It is far wiser to do your own installations and ensure that all data flowing through the organization has end-to-end encryption.','publish','open','open','','5-react-training-courses-for-beginners-3','','','2019-02-28 07:49:34','2019-02-28 07:49:34','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?p=328',0,'post','',3),(329,1,'2019-02-28 07:52:04','2019-02-28 07:52:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Technology has come a long way and still has a long way to go in many respects. It has <g class=\"gr_ gr_10 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling multiReplace\" id=\"10\" data-gr-id=\"10\">revolutionised</g> the lives of people all over the world and made life easier in a variety of ways. In the world of business especially, technology has played an undeniable role.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> It boosts efficiency, as staff now have more time to focus their efforts on other tasks and use their talent in other aspects of the business. </p></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They play a role in making operations more seamless, bridging the gap between consumers and businesses, as well as helping many see exponential growth. For this reason, it is imperative to outline the many ways in which technology has helped businesses, especially in 2018.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> One of the first ways that technology has made businesses more efficient in 2018 is through automation. As a result, numerous mundane tasks that could decrease productivity can now be allocated to technology.&nbsp; </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\n\n(Source: blog.businesscasestudies.co.uk)\n\n</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','How Technology Made Businesses More Efficient','They play a role in making operations more seamless, bridging the gap between authorities, consumers and businesses.  ','publish','open','open','','5-react-training-courses-for-beginners-4','','','2019-02-28 07:52:04','2019-02-28 07:52:04','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?p=329',0,'post','',3),(333,1,'2019-02-28 08:22:47','2019-02-28 08:22:47','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have you ever thought about a guarantee in which you invest your money and get returns? While people tend to have different ideas on the best ways to invest, some options are now made simpler so that you increase the chances of getting your returns on investment.&nbsp; </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p>The use of apps in investment ideas is a great way to enjoy <g class=\"gr_ gr_7 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar only-ins replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"7\" data-gr-id=\"7\">convenience</g>. That makes it essential you understand some of the ideas through which apps can help you get returns on investment. </p></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Using the profit accumulator is one such way<g class=\"gr_ gr_6 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Style replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"6\" data-gr-id=\"6\">,and</g> you should understand why it increases your chances of getting returns on investment. Using profit accumulator helps you in matched betting so that you place your money through bookmakers and track the profits.&nbsp; </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> The use of technology provides you with all details online so that regardless of the location you live or work in the United Kingdom, you can bet and enjoy your returns on investment.  <br>One of the good things with matched betting is that it dramatically reduces the risks since you are presented with many bonuses. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>(Source: blog.businesscasestudies.co.uk)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Ideas for High Returns on Investment','Using the profit accumulator is one such way, and you should understand why it increases your chances of the profits.  ','publish','open','open','','5-react-training-courses-for-beginners-5','','','2019-02-28 08:22:47','2019-02-28 08:22:47','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?p=333',0,'post','',3),(346,1,'2019-03-01 02:17:43','2019-03-01 02:17:43','','home-processing-video-intro-slider-slide-01-image-01','','inherit','open','closed','','home-processing-video-intro-slider-slide-01-image-01','','','2019-03-01 02:17:43','2019-03-01 02:17:43','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/home-processing-video-intro-slider-slide-01-image-01.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(347,1,'2019-03-01 02:17:45','2019-03-01 02:17:45','','home-processing-video-intro-slider-slide-01-image-02','','inherit','open','closed','','home-processing-video-intro-slider-slide-01-image-02','','','2019-03-01 02:1