elopment%20is%20still%20unstable%20and%20shrinks%20every%20year.%22%2C%22solution%22%3A%22Market%20development%20%E2%80%93%20increasing%20market%20share%20in%20new%20markets%20such%20as%20servers%20and%20networking%20equipment.%20ARM%E2%80%99s%20technology%20is%20well%20placed%20to%20provide%20lower%20power%20options%20to%20transport%2C%20distribute%2C%20analyze%20and%20store%20data%20across%20the%20internet.%22%7D%2C%7B%22problem%22%3A%22Demand%20for%20energy%20efficient%20technology%20%E2%80%93%20the%20market%20demands%20high%20performance%20products%20using%20low%20power%20technology.%22%2C%22solution%22%3A%22This%20case%20study%20will%20demonstrate%20how%20ARM%E2%80%99s%20strategies%20contribute%20to%20the%20achievement%20of%20its%20business%20vision%2C%20aims%20and%20objectives%20using%20an%20integrated%20approach%20focusing%20on%20innovation%2C%20its%20people%20and%20its%20network%20of%20partners.%22%7D%5D\"][tm_spacer size=\"lg:68\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][tm_heading custom_google_font=\"\" font_size=\"sm:28;md:34;lg:40\" line_height=\"1.4\"]Results:[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"sm:20\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"3/4\"][tm_heading tag=\"div\" custom_google_font=\"\" font_size=\"sm:18;md:21;lg:24\"]In its first year as a public company, Freeserve has enjoyed considerable success in possibly the UK’s most competitive market. [/tm_heading][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][tm_spacer size=\"sm:40;lg:85\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner offset=\"vc_col-md-6\"][tm_accordion style=\"02\" open_index=\"1\" items=\"%5B%7B%22title%22%3A%22New%20multiple%20site%20connectivity%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22We%20use%20a%20newly%20developed%20technology%20to%20connect%20sites%20that%20are%20based%20on%20different%20types%20of%20servers%20and%20networks%2C%20SiteConnect%2C%20which%20helps%20to%20reduce%20the%20misinterpretation%20of%20signals%20as%20well%20as%20the%20loss%20of%20data%20during%20transfering.%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22IT%20security%20%26%20software%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22To%20keep%20your%20systems%2C%20your%20devices%2C%20and%20network%20stay%20secure%2C%20we%20have%20developed%20a%20new%20program%20that%20limits%20the%20access%20of%20suspicious%20objects%20or%20people%20and%20authenticate%20all%20logins%20to%20the%20system.%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Weak%20hosted%20capability%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22Some%20hosts%20are%20unaware%20of%20the%20potential%20risks%20as%20well%20as%20security%20loopholes%20in%20their%20system.%20By%20detecting%20these%20errors%20and%20taking%20prompt%20actions%20on%20improving%20firewalls%2C%20we%20can%20upgrade%20the%20system%20security.%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Build%20internal%20network%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22The%20internal%20network%20is%20essential%20for%20all%20companies%20and%20corporations%2C%20especially%20for%20those%20working%20in%20IT%20sector.%20To%20avoid%20possible%20risks%20when%20sharing%20internal%20confidential%20files%20and%20documentation%20to%20an%20external%20receiver%2C%20internal%20network%20must%20be%20strong.%22%7D%5D\"][tm_spacer size=\"sm:70\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner offset=\"vc_col-md-6\"][tm_popup_video style=\"poster-02\" image_size=\"custom\" poster_full_wide=\"\" align=\"right\" sm_align=\"center\" poster=\"695\" image_size_width=\"540\" image_size_height=\"320\" video=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vqZuSUtczbU\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][tm_spacer size=\"sm:100;lg:122\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" background_color=\"custom\" custom_background_color=\"#f5f5f5\"][vc_column][tm_spacer size=\"lg:100\"][tm_heading style=\"modern\" tag=\"h6\" custom_google_font=\"\" align=\"center\" text_color=\"custom\" custom_text_color=\"#ababab\"]Testimonials[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"lg:23\"][tm_heading custom_google_font=\"\" align=\"center\" font_size=\"sm:28;md:34;lg:40\" line_height=\"1.4\"]Why do people <mark>love our service?</mark>[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"lg:75\"][tm_testimonial number=\"9\" auto_play=\"5000\" pagination=\"01\" carousel_gutter=\"lg:20\" carousel_items_display=\"xs:1;sm:2;lg:2\"][tm_spacer size=\"lg:86\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\n','Arden-Internal Networking','The prospects for a company operating in this new market are varied and exciting. The potential commercial opportunities are very significant indeed. This case study looks at Freeserve, its corporate objectives and the strategies it has developed to achieve them.','publish','open','closed','','arden-internal-networking','','','2019-03-11 07:12:22','2019-03-11 07:12:22','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?case_study=arden-internal-networking',0,'case_study','',0),(740,1,'2019-03-09 07:12:35','2019-03-09 07:12:35','<p>[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" background_image=\"743\" background_position=\"center\"][vc_column][tm_spacer size=\"lg:86\"][tm_image image_size=\"custom\" align=\"center\" image=\"744\" image_size_width=\"83\"][tm_spacer size=\"lg:28\"][tm_heading custom_google_font=\"\" align=\"center\" text_color=\"custom\" custom_text_color=\"#ffffff\" font_size=\"sm:44;md:54;lg:64\" line_height=\"1.13\"]A Freeserve case study on<br />\nexpanding market[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"lg:204\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][tm_spacer size=\"sm:100;lg:111\"][tm_heading custom_google_font=\"\" font_size=\"sm:28;md:34;lg:40\" line_height=\"1.4\"]Overview[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"lg:25\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner offset=\"vc_col-md-5\"][tm_heading custom_google_font=\"\" font_weight=\"400\" text_color=\"custom\" custom_text_color=\"#002fa6\" font_size=\"sm:20;md:24;lg:28\" line_height=\"1.43\"]The choice of corporate strategy will determine the marketing, human resource, financial and operations strategies.[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"lg:56\"][tm_heading custom_google_font=\"\" text_transform=\"uppercase\" font_size=\"lg:15\" line_height=\"1.27\"]Loren Miramar[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"lg:6\"][tm_heading tag=\"div\" custom_google_font=\"\" text_color=\"custom\" custom_text_color=\"#7e7e7e\" font_size=\"lg:14\"]/ Group Chief Executive - Aqua Group[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"sm:40\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner offset=\"vc_col-md-7\"][tm_heading tag=\"div\" custom_google_font=\"\"]Freeserve realized that it was important to re-brand its product and evolve from an Internet Service Provider (ISP), which merely provides the customer with access to the World Wide Web, into a true portal, with a site full of interest and content.[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"lg:72\"][tm_case_study_details][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][tm_spacer size=\"lg:65\"][tm_problem_solution problem_label=\"Requirements\" solution_label=\"Our solution\" items=\"%5B%7B%22problem%22%3A%22The%20communication%20between%20machines%20of%20different%20kinds%20sometimes%20cause%20troubles%20and%20inaccurate%20signal%20decoding%20results.%22%2C%22solution%22%3A%22Advancements%20in%20technology%20%E2%80%93%20including%20machine-to-machine%20communications%20between%20smart%20sensors%2C%20referred%20to%20as%20%E2%80%98The%20Internet%20of%20Things%E2%80%99.%20For%20example%2C%20appliances%20in%20the%20home%20that%20can%20be%20monitored%20and%20controlled%20wirelessly%20by%20the%20homeowner%20wherever%20they%20are.%22%7D%2C%7B%22problem%22%3A%22The%20potential%20market%20for%20servers%20and%20networking%20equipment%20development%20is%20still%20unstable%20and%20shrinks%20every%20year.%22%2C%22solution%22%3A%22Market%20development%20%E2%80%93%20increasing%20market%20share%20in%20new%20markets%20such%20as%20servers%20and%20networking%20equipment.%20ARM%E2%80%99s%20technology%20is%20well%20placed%20to%20provide%20lower%20power%20options%20to%20transport%2C%20distribute%2C%20analyse%20and%20store%20data%20across%20the%20internet.%22%7D%2C%7B%22problem%22%3A%22Demand%20for%20energy%20efficient%20technology%20%E2%80%93%20the%20market%20demands%20high%20performance%20products%20using%20low%20power%20technology.%22%2C%22solution%22%3A%22This%20case%20study%20will%20demonstrate%20how%20ARM%E2%80%99s%20strategies%20contribute%20to%20the%20achievement%20of%20its%20business%20vision%2C%20aims%20and%20objectives%20using%20an%20integrated%20approach%20focusing%20on%20innovation%2C%20its%20people%20and%20its%20network%20of%20partners.%22%7D%5D\"][tm_spacer size=\"lg:68\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][tm_heading custom_google_font=\"\" font_size=\"sm:28;md:34;lg:40\" line_height=\"1.4\"]Results:[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"sm:20\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"3/4\"][tm_heading tag=\"div\" custom_google_font=\"\" font_size=\"sm:18;md:21;lg:24\"]Traditional economic theory suggests that all companies attempt to maximise profits at all times. Freeserve, however, has chosen to maximise growth.[/tm_heading][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][tm_spacer size=\"sm:40;lg:85\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner offset=\"vc_col-md-6\"][tm_accordion style=\"02\" open_index=\"1\" items=\"%5B%7B%22title%22%3A%22New%20multiple%20site%20connectivity%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22We%20use%20a%20newly%20developed%20technology%20to%20connect%20sites%20that%20are%20based%20on%20different%20types%20of%20servers%20and%20networks%2C%20SiteConnect%2C%20which%20helps%20to%20reduce%20the%20misinterpretation%20of%20signals%20as%20well%20as%20the%20loss%20of%20data%20during%20transfering.%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22IT%20security%20%26%20software%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22To%20keep%20your%20systems%2C%20your%20devices%2C%20and%20network%20stay%20secure%2C%20we%20have%20developed%20a%20new%20program%20that%20limits%20the%20access%20of%20suspicious%20objects%20or%20people%20and%20authenticate%20all%20logins%20to%20the%20system.%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Weak%20hosted%20capability%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22Some%20hosts%20are%20unaware%20of%20the%20potential%20risks%20as%20well%20as%20security%20loopholes%20in%20their%20system.%20By%20detecting%20these%20errors%20and%20taking%20prompt%20actions%20on%20improving%20firewalls%2C%20we%20can%20upgrade%20the%20system%20security.%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Build%20internal%20network%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22The%20internal%20network%20is%20essential%20for%20all%20companies%20and%20corporations%2C%20especially%20for%20those%20working%20in%20IT%20sector.%20To%20avoid%20possible%20risks%20when%20sharing%20internal%20confidential%20files%20and%20documentation%20to%20an%20external%20receiver%2C%20internal%20network%20must%20be%20strong.%22%7D%5D\"][tm_spacer size=\"sm:70\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner offset=\"vc_col-md-6\"][tm_popup_video style=\"poster-02\" image_size=\"custom\" poster_full_wide=\"\" align=\"right\" sm_align=\"center\" poster=\"695\" image_size_width=\"540\" image_size_height=\"320\" video=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vqZuSUtczbU\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][tm_spacer size=\"sm:100;lg:122\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" background_color=\"custom\" custom_background_color=\"#f5f5f5\"][vc_column][tm_spacer size=\"lg:100\"][tm_heading style=\"modern\" tag=\"h6\" custom_google_font=\"\" align=\"center\" text_color=\"custom\" custom_text_color=\"#ababab\"]Testimonials[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"lg:23\"][tm_heading custom_google_font=\"\" align=\"center\" font_size=\"sm:28;md:34;lg:40\" line_height=\"1.4\"]Virtual technology in a <mark class=\"secondary-color\">Refined IT System</mark>[/tm_heading][tm_spacer size=\"lg:75\"][tm_testimonial number=\"9\" auto_play=\"5000\" pagination=\"01\" carousel_gutter=\"lg:20\" carousel_items_display=\"xs:1;sm:2;lg:2\"][tm_spacer size=\"lg:86\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\n','A Freeserve case study','Freeserve realized that it was important to re-brand its product and evolve from an Internet Service Provider (ISP), which merely provides the customer with access to the World Wide Web, into a true portal, with a site full of interest and content.','publish','open','closed','','a-freeserve-case-study','','','2019-03-09 0