e &amp; practical plans for successfully transform businesses based on their needs.\"][tm_box_image align=\"center\" heading_color=\"primary\" image=\"2979\" heading=\"Value Added Services\" text=\"Unstructured Supplementary Service Data (USSD) in short is a service that allows mobile phone users to interact with a remote application from their device in real time. A predefined session is started once a user dials in to facilitate the transfer of information between your application and the user. It is a highly scalable service as it does not require an internet connection and is supported by both feature and smartphones.\"][tm_box_image align=\"center\" heading_color=\"primary\" image=\"2980\" heading=\"Payment Solutions\" text=\"Enhancing the strength and security of firewalls to protect online data from malicious sources.\"][tm_box_image align=\"center\" heading_color=\"primary\" image=\"2976\" heading=\"System Integration\" text=\"Programming is taken care of by our experienced and professional specialist in IT management.\"][/tm_grid][tm_spacer size=\"sm:100;lg:120\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]','Services','','publish','closed','closed','','services','','','2021-07-06 15:04:22','2021-07-06 15:04:22','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?page_id=773',0,'page','',0),(779,1,'2019-03-12 02:45:12','2019-03-12 02:45:12','','mitech-box-image-style-01-image-06','','inherit','open','closed','','mitech-box-image-style-01-image-06','','','2021-03-24 13:01:05','2021-03-24 13:01:05','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/mitech-box-image-style-01-image-06.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(780,1,'2019-03-12 02:45:13','2019-03-12 02:45:13','','mitech-box-image-style-01-image-05','','inherit','open','closed','','mitech-box-image-style-01-image-05','','','2021-03-24 13:01:05','2021-03-24 13:01:05','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/mitech-box-image-style-01-image-05.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(781,1,'2019-03-12 02:45:15','2019-03-12