acer size=\"xs:30\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section]','Footer Shop','','publish','closed','closed','','footer-shop','','','2020-12-25 04:23:29','2020-12-25 04:23:29','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?ic_footer=footer-shop',0,'ic_footer','',0),(2775,1,'2020-12-25 04:36:19','2020-12-25 04:36:19','','hshop-payment','','inherit','open','closed','','hshop-payment','','','2020-12-25 04:36:19','2020-12-25 04:36:19','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/hshop-payment.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2794,1,'2020-12-26 14:36:06','2020-12-26 14:36:06','','hshop-banner-sidebar','','inherit','open','closed','','hshop-banner-sidebar','','','2021-06-24 15:38:54','2021-06-24 15:38:54','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/hshop-banner-sidebar.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2803,1,'2021-01-06 02:51:21','2021-01-06 02:51:21','','mitech-rtl','','inherit','open','closed','','mitech-rtl-2','','','2021-03-24 13:01:06','2021-03-24 13:01:06','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/mitech-rtl.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2804,1,'2021-01-06 02:51:29','2021-01-06 02:51:29','','mitech-shop','','inherit','open','closed','','mitech-shop-2','','','2021-03-24 13:01:06','2021-03-24 13:01:06','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/mitech-shop.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2805,1,'2021-01-06 02:51:34','2021-01-06 02:51:34','','software-innovation','','inherit','open','closed','','software-innovation-2','','','2021-03-24 13:01:06','2021-03-24 13:01:06','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/software-innovation.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2806,1,'2019-02-18 09:19:37','2019-02-18 09:19:37','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Understanding some of the most prominent ways technology has drastically improved the ways we do business is ideal if you are interested in the field of technology or if you are seeking new methods to boost productivity for your own business or brand today. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p> Technology is always rapidly evolving and expanding, providing new opportunities and innovative solutions to some of today’s most pressing matters. </p></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Technology is more innovative than ever, with new languages, applications, and hardware being developed each year. Innovative technologies range from cryptocurrencies such as Bitcoin to utilizing virtual reality and new gaming mechanisms, and super fast LaserJet printers.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Because of how innovative the technology industry is, there are always new markets and niches to learn about whether you are doing so as a hobby or professionally. The speed <g class=\"gr_ gr_14 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar multiReplace\" id=\"14\" data-gr-id=\"14\">in</g> which we are able to use technology for work and play has drastically increased since the dawn of the internet. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\n\n (Source: blog.businesscasestudies.co.uk)\n\n</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','5 Ways Technology Has Improved Business Today','Today, it is uncommon to not have access to high-speed wireless internet, regardless of your location on Earth. ','publish','open','open','','5-react-training-courses-for-beginners','','','2019-02-18 09:19:37','2019-02-18 09:19:37','',0,'http://staging.novajii.com/?p=2806',0,'post','',3),(2808,1,'2019-02-26 04:32:39','2019-02-26 04:32:39','<p>[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" background_color=\"custom\" custom_background_color=\"#072a83\"][vc_column][rev_slider alias=\"processing\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" content_placement=\"middle\" lg_spacing=\"padding_top:100;padding_bottom:100\"][vc_column offset=\"vc_col-md-6\"][vc_row_inner content_alignment=\"right\" sm_content_alignment=\"center\" max_width=\"600px\"]